flowchart LR
  O[Encrypted object storage\nobject bytes] --> S[Go orchestrator\nsynthetic guard in local test mode]
  S --> R[Python document endpoint\ninternal token]
  R --> D[Base64 decode\nnonempty + 10 MiB maximum]
  D --> X[SHA-256 recomputation]
  X -->|mismatch| E422[422 evidence mismatch]
  X -->|match| C{Processor selected}
  C -->|PaddleOCR| P[PaddleOCR en\ntemporary file]
  C -->|Docling| L[Docling converter\ntemporary file]
  C -->|optional VLM| V[VLM structure extraction only]
  P --> I[Canonical output digest]
  L --> I
  V --> I
  I --> MR[manual_review only\nno automated eligibility verdict]
  MR --> G[Go completion with\nPostgreSQL claim token]
  G --> DB[PostgreSQL processing job\nlease fenced completion]
  DB --> HR[Human reviewer\nchecks, consent, expiry]
  HR --> DC[Accountable final decision]
